export anchor FamilyBrightStyle:
    number: 383
    screen: SmartHome
    name: Family bright
    idea: A home screen the whole family can use, big candy bright room tiles with thick friendly icons and dark ink on a deep slate page, every touch target at least 64px and every state spelled out in plain words.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #15182b, deep slate page
        card: #20243d, energy and scene cards
        card2: #2a2f4d, number chips, scene buttons, fields
        line: #3a4068, 3px card borders
        ink: #f6f5ff, text on dark
        mute: #b9bcd9, helper text
        dark: #17142b, text and badges on bright tiles, primary button
        sun: #ffd34d, living room tile, peak bars, sheet heads
        sky: #6fd0ff, kitchen tile, day bars, focus halo
        berry: #ff7fa8, bedroom tile
        lime: #9ef07a, front door tile and battery
        grape: #c6a2ff, garden tile
        tang: #ff9d4d, the alert card
    type:
        A heavy rounded stack, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito,
        Quicksand, Varela Round, Arial Rounded MT Bold. Base 17px at 600.
        The greeting and tile figures 34px at 900, card titles 24px at 900,
        room names 21px at 900, badges 14px at 800, button text 19px at 800.
    layout:
        A deep slate page. A greeting row has a 64px yellow rounded square
        with B, Hi, family and the home name, day and time. A full width
        tangerine alert card with a 6px darker ledge holds a 64px dark
        circle with a garage icon, The garage door is open in heavy type
        over It has been open for 2 hours, and a dark pill Close now 64px
        tall. Five candy bright room tiles follow in one row, yellow living
        room, sky kitchen, berry bedroom, lime front door and grape garden,
        each with dark ink, a 64px round well with a thick icon, the name, a
        big temperature where there is one, a dark pill badge with its own
        icon and word such as Lights on, Lights off, Bedtime heat, Locked
        and Motion, and a friendly sentence. Below, an Energy today card
        shows a big battery drawing 64 percent full in lime, number chips
        for used, sun and battery, and chunky rounded bars, yellow for the
        evening peak. A Scenes card has four 96px tall buttons with coloured
        round icon wells and a hint line, Movie turned white with On now and
        a star. Below 1100px tiles go three across and the cards stack, and
        at phone width tiles go two across with the living room full width.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px tile gaps, 18 to 24px padding and a 64px minimum touch size.
    density: Low. Five big tiles, then energy and four big scene buttons.
    corners: 28px tiles and cards, 24px scene buttons, 20px fields, full pills for buttons and badges.
    borders: Bright tiles have none. Dark cards use a 3px #3a4068 border.
    shadows: A solid 6px drop ledge under tiles and the alert, like a toy block.
    icons:
        Thick 2.6 stroke rounded icons at 24 to 36px in round wells. Each
        state badge has its own icon and a plain word.
    focus: A 4px white outline offset 4px plus a 10px sky halo.
    tone: Warm and plain, like talking to kids, such as Hi, family, Locked tight and Something moved out there.
